===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Revavroom|8}}, one of the {{TCG|SVP Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Outta-Control Dash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Stellar Crown|Revavroom|109}} from the {{TCG|Stellar Crown}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

